OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 14 FEB
OL,4,G0900FThe Classic FM Hall of Fame Hour
OL,5,     GTim brings you an hour of the
OL,6,     Gbiggest classical hits from the
OL,7,     GClassic FM Hall of Fame - the
OL,8,     Gannual Top 300 chart voted for by
OL,9,     Gyou.
OL,10,G1000FAled Jones
OL,11,     GAled invites you to join him for
OL,12,     Gthree hours of the best classical
OL,13,     Gmusic, with an unmissable morning
OL,14,     Gof old favourites and new
OL,15,     Gdiscoveries.
OL,16,G1300FAlexander Armstrong
OL,17,     GAlexander presents the perfect
OL,18,     Gclassical music for a relaxing
OL,19,     GSaturday afternoon, including the
OL,20,     GHall of Fame 3 at 3: three pieces
OL,21,     Gof music from the Top 300, as
OL,22,     Gvoted by you.
